---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
const sitekey=import.meta.env.PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITEKEY||'';
---
<Layout title="Request a pilot — FetchX"><div class="container pilot-layout"><div class="pilot-intro"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-dot"></span> A SMALL START. A USEFUL ANSWER.</span><h1>Let’s scope<br/>your first<br/>dataset.</h1><p>Share the websites your business depends on and the data you need. We’ll review your sources and agree a pilot scope before any work begins.</p><div class="pilot-aside"><span>WHAT HAPPENS NEXT</span><ol><li><span>01</span> We review your sources and fields.</li><li><span>02</span> Together, we define the pilot scope.</li><li><span>03</span> You receive an agreed dataset.</li></ol></div></div><div class="pilot-form-shell"><noscript><p class="noscript-note">This form needs JavaScript for verification. You can also email <a href="mailto:sales@headrun.ai">sales@headrun.ai</a> with your sources and fields.</p></noscript><div class="form-progress"><span class="active" data-progress="1"><b>1</b> Your data</span><i></i><span data-progress="2"><b>2</b> Your details</span></div><form class="pilot-form" novalidate data-sitekey={sitekey}><div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label for="website_confirm">Leave this field blank</label><input id="website_confirm" name="website_confirm" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></div><div class="selected-offer" data-offer>SELECTED OFFER: PILOT · FROM $99 ONCE</div><fieldset data-step="1"><legend>Tell us about your data.</legend><div class="form-field"><label for="websites">Target websites <span>· up to three</span></label><textarea id="websites" name="websites" placeholder="https://example.com&#10;One website per line" rows="3" required maxlength="1500"></textarea><small>Example page URLs are helpful. Please don’t include login details.</small></div><div class="form-field"><label for="fields">Which fields do you need?</label><textarea id="fields" name="fields" placeholder="e.g. Product name, price, availability, source URL" rows="2" required maxlength="2000"></textarea></div><div class="form-row"><div class="form-field"><label for="frequency">Desired frequency</label><select id="frequency" name="frequency" required><option value="">Select a schedule</option><option>One-time pilot</option><option>Daily</option><option>Weekly</option><option>Monthly</option><option>Let’s discuss</option></select></div><div class="form-field"><label for="volume">Estimated monthly volume</label><select id="volume" name="volume" required><option value="">Select a volume</option><option>Up to 500 records</option><option>501–5,000 records</option><option>5,001–20,000 records</option><option>More than 20,000</option><option>Not sure yet</option></select></div></div><div class="form-field"><label for="format">Preferred delivery format</label><select id="format" name="format"><option>CSV</option><option>JSON</option><option>Let’s discuss an integration</option></select></div><div class="form-actions"><span>Next: your contact details</span><button type="button" class="button button-ink" data-next>Continue <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></button></div></fieldset><fieldset data-step="2" hidden disabled><legend>A little about your team.</legend><div class="form-field"><label for="name">Your name</label><input id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Alex Morgan" required maxlength="120"/></div><div class="form-field"><label for="company">Company</label><input id="company" name="company" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Your company name" required maxlength="160"/></div><div class="form-field"><label for="email">Work email</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="alex@company.com" required maxlength="254"/></div><div class="form-field"><label for="notes">Anything else? <span>· optional</span></label><textarea id="notes" name="notes" placeholder="Tell us how you plan to use the data." maxlength="2000" rows="3"></textarea></div><div class="verification-wrapper"><div id="pilot-turnstile"></div><p class="verification-status" aria-live="polite">Verification will load when you reach this step.</p></div><p class="form-disclaimer">By sending this request, you ask FetchX to contact you about this enquiry. See our <a href="/privacy">Privacy notice</a> and <a href="/terms">Website terms</a>. This does not start a purchase or subscription.</p><div class="form-actions"><button type="button" class="form-back" data-back><Icon name="arrow" size={16}/> Back</button><button class="button button-ink" type="submit" disabled><span data-submit-label>Send pilot request</span> <Icon name="diagonal" size={17}/></button></div></fieldset><p class="form-error" aria-live="polite" role="status" hidden></p></form><p class="form-fallback">Prefer email? Write to <a href="mailto:sales@headrun.ai">sales@headrun.ai</a> with a few example websites and the fields you need.</p><div class="form-result" tabindex="-1" hidden><div class="result-check"><Icon name="check" size={27}/></div><span class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center;margin-bottom:15px">YOUR ENQUIRY IS SAVED</span><h2>Thank you.<br/>Let’s make data useful.</h2><p>We’ve received your request. We’ll review your sources and scope your pilot before any work begins.</p><div class="enquiry-reference"><span>Your reference</span><br/><strong data-reference></strong></div><p>There’s no need to submit again. For a follow-up, email <a href="mailto:sales@headrun.ai" data-followup>sales@headrun.ai</a> and include this reference.</p><a class="button button-outline" href="/samples">Explore sample data <Icon name="arrow" size={16}/></a></div></div></div><script>import '../scripts/pilot.ts';</script></Layout>
